  -----------------
    INPUT SUMMARY
  -----------------

  # METHOD
  --------
  Atomic partitioning (real-space)     : TFVC (Topological Fuzzy Voronoi Cells)
  Energy decomposition                 : ENPART (one- and two-center IQA terms, see below)
  Local spin analysis                  : SPIN

  # ENPART
  --------
  Functional              : CASSCF
  Atom-pair skip threshold: THREBOD = 0
  Two-electron grid       : 40 x 146 (# GRID)
  Rotation angles (2E)    : 0.162 / 0.182 (calibrated)

  # DM
  ----
  DM level: 2-RDM
  Source  : pySCF
  1-RDM   : LiH-35-CAS22.dm1
  2-RDM   : LiH-35-CAS22.dm2

